Under the "CAN router" I mean the following usage scenario:
 1. the chip with Zephir is receiving raw CAN frames from any other interface but CAN, as raw packets stream;
 2. the recv thread is calling the can_send for above stream without any intermediate copy;
 3. error. Out of bound reading for RTR packet.
 
BTW in theory the security problem could arise when working with the ARM sec/normal world modes frames handling, and not in the case of a "multi-user".
